Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.19,0:00:03.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：世界决斗嘉年华
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}预选赛第二天{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.21,0:00:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以心园市为舞台{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从世界各地聚集而来的最强决斗者们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.75,0:00:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}围绕心之碎片展开激烈战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.78,0:00:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}集齐5个心之碎片完成的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.64,0:00:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能进入决赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.82,0:00:17.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管什么样的家伙都放马过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.18,0:00:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧 我！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.23,0:00:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.78,0:00:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（远吠）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.51,0:00:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（吠叫声）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.08,0:00:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀 让大家担心了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和委员长 都已经没事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.64,0:01:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 那家伙为了保险起见回家去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.33,0:01:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊，太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.02,0:01:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）我们当中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.31,0:01:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}留到最后的，只有游马啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.06,0:01:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）大会也到第二天了现在剩下的参赛者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.93,0:01:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都是相当强的对手。别大意。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.12,0:01:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，包在我身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）我说，总觉得好像忘了谁……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）我也……还留着呢……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.88,0:01:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！凯特酱！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.17,0:01:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我凑齐2个了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.61,0:01:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！凯特酱，好厉害啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.81,0:01:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈，我凑齐4个了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.33,0:01:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过全都是险胜就是了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.36,0:01:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才、才没那回事呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.71,0:01:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个确实是有那么点苦战啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.57,0:01:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦？有那么点啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.22,0:01:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.44,0:01:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！你看到我的英姿了吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.69,0:02:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂、喂！我的心灵碎片！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.23,0:02:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（狗叫声）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.41,0:02:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还给我～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.76,0:02:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么狗会把心灵碎片叼走啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.99,0:02:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去会失去资格的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.25,0:02:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底该怎么办啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.05,0:02:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.01,0:02:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这、这次是猫吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.37,0:02:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猫咪们，去帮游马找
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.99,0:02:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心灵碎片吧！喵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.77,0:02:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（叫声）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.98,0:02:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟也请鸟儿们帮忙找找怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这、这种事我怎么可能做得到啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.55,0:02:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀，是这样啊？做不到啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.63,0:02:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯～……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.12,0:03:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（机器人）垃圾，垃圾。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.99,0:03:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.41,0:03:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的！？狗狗们的所在地你知道了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.78,0:03:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（叫声）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.89,0:03:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（低吼声）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这、这些家伙到底是什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是游马的心灵碎片！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.66,0:03:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（叫声）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.55,0:03:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，这里交给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.77,0:03:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们已经逃不掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.03,0:03:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把游马的心灵碎片还回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.80,0:03:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（低吼声）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.32,0:03:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手！你们这些家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵什么吵！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.05,0:04:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狗、狗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.07,0:04:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说话了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.75,0:04:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙是 心之碎片！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 你们几个……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.46,0:04:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然偷了这种东西！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.98,0:04:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这蠢货～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底发生了什么怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.90,0:04:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么狗会在背地里拿着心之碎片？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.76,0:04:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个心之碎片是你们的东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.13,0:04:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是手下干的事能不能看在我的面子上饶了他？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.67,0:04:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 不……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只偷东西的狗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.03,0:04:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.36,0:04:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是道歉就能了事 那还要警察干嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.06,0:04:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊 说偷东西的狗我可不能当作没听见哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本来就是嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狗总是干坏事。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.14,0:04:41.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就说那只柴犬 之前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.89,0:04:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还抢了三毛的鱼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.01,0:04:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小雏被那只巴哥犬一吠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.12,0:04:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可怜巴巴地从围墙上摔了下来。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.38,0:04:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且你看那是什么啊，那张奇怪的脸！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.09,0:04:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.11,0:04:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那你们那边又怎么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.31,0:05:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那边那只花猫，把约翰老爷爷的饭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.52,0:05:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给偷吃了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.02,0:05:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.35,0:05:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}汪 汪。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.76,0:05:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都安静。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.76,0:05:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然这样，就用决斗来分胜负吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.64,0:05:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大家）决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正合我意。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为交换，如果我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.01,0:05:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狗就要从这条街上滚出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.74,0:05:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这句话，原封不动还给你你们这些猫。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的要跟狗决斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.68,0:05:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的心灵碎片。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我感受到了……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.36,0:05:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是历经数万年的犬与猫的宿命对决。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连你也这么悠哉……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.27,0:05:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的心灵碎片！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.15,0:05:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.51,0:05:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:03.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.47,0:06:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.94,0:07:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫咪 你可别把我的心灵碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.54,0:07:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给忘了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.84,0:07:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猫儿直冲。 我的回合 抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.87,0:08:00.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤弃猫。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.78,0:08:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力100 这么弱的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.32,0:08:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 恐怕她……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《狗这种东西 只要一看到食物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.11,0:08:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会立刻扑上去 真是下贱的动物。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.38,0:08:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把容易攻击的怪兽当作诱饵{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.91,0:08:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来瞄准计数器》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.43,0:08:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 我盖放２张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轮到老夫的回合了。 抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.69,0:08:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（２人）狗 把卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.71,0:08:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（２人）抽了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.90,0:08:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老夫召唤 三头犬。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.44,0:08:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地上 有三头犬的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.88,0:08:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}手牌里的其他三头犬{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.99,0:08:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.56,0:08:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 发动魔法卡 双头犬。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.27,0:08:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 在自己场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.95,0:08:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有三头犬２只的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.64,0:09:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从卡组把三头犬
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.41,0:09:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再特殊召唤１只。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.02,0:09:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级４的怪兽有３只？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.26,0:09:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道是叠放？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.38,0:09:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老夫用 等级４的三头犬３只
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.13,0:09:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.62,0:09:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.21,0:09:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧　犬世界之王　横纲。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.93,0:09:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}烟熏狗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.80,0:09:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明是条狗　居然还会超量召唤唔　真是的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定他的决斗战术{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.37,0:09:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比游马还强。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.43,0:09:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.57,0:09:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错　就这样一口咬住猎物吧》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.95,0:09:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡　汪达布尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.65,0:09:51.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以在自己的场地上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.01,0:09:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将2只汪达布尔衍生物特殊召唤的说。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.55,0:09:59.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}furthermore 发动装备魔法　狗王！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.59,0:10:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狗王可以提升装备怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1只场上的狗怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.22,0:10:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就提升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:10.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.39,0:10:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有3只狗怪兽所以{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.06,0:10:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升1500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.09,0:10:18.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力4100！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.28,0:10:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去小猫咪她…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.22,0:10:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的心灵碎片要！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.33,0:10:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错一回合秒杀，结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.70,0:10:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧～ 烟熏狗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.99,0:10:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击弃猫。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.09,0:10:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡 打开！ 猫骗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.45,0:10:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是在对方怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.51,0:10:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击我的小猫咪时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.49,0:10:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效对方的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.49,0:10:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将那只怪兽退回手牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.70,0:10:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猫的那点小聪明，我早就看穿了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动烟熏狗的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.63,0:10:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过消耗1个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.49,0:10:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将陷阱卡的效果无效并破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.86,0:11:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}烟熏狗居然还有这种效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.06,0:11:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真就一回合秒杀！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.78,0:11:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猫猫酱！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.47,0:11:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵……是咱家赢了呀。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.01,0:11:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）那可不好说。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.19,0:11:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.55,0:11:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在即将受到烟熏狗攻击之前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.75,0:11:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动了速攻魔法 猫粮。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.96,0:11:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以通过解放弃猫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.77,0:11:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤弃猫娘。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且弃猫娘在攻击表示时
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.63,0:11:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗中不会被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.54,0:11:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还挺有一手的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.73,0:11:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过你的生命值只剩500了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.65,0:11:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经是背水一战了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放1张卡回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.48,0:11:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束时，汪哒兽衍生物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会因其效果被破坏的说。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.89,0:11:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挺能干的嘛。明明是条狗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.75,0:11:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然能看穿人类的陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.77,0:11:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴，猫人！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.45,0:11:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:12:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看好了，只会服从人类的愚蠢的狗们！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.19,0:12:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}见识下猫的高贵孤高与野性之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.06,0:12:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤猫娘！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.29,0:12:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级4的弃猫娘与猫娘
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.53,0:12:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.82,0:12:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.25,0:12:27.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，猫娘魔法师！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.98,0:12:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵…喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动装备魔法，木天蓼涡轮！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.58,0:12:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡让自己场上的1只猫的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.78,0:12:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升1200点。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.48,0:12:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了，猫猫！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.67,0:12:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来就超过了对手怪兽的攻击力。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.87,0:12:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，因这个效果强化力量时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该怪兽无法进行攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.58,0:13:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，果然终究不过是愚蠢的猫罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.12,0:13:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不好说哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.31,0:13:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动猫女魔法师的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.51,0:13:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗1个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.03,0:13:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合，将攻击力减半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.23,0:13:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就可以进行直接攻击了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.75,0:13:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.77,0:13:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧～猫女魔法师！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.13,0:13:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～猫眼魔法！哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.21,0:13:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.90,0:13:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖上两张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.26,0:13:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，猫女孩魔术师的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.28,0:13:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就恢复原状了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.31,0:13:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？知道狗的愚蠢了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.17,0:13:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔～ 你竟敢！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.12,0:13:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}区区一只猫竟敢……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢反抗我们狗族。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.04,0:13:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 我绝对不会原谅你！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.12,0:13:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（众人）女孩子！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.32,0:14:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎 啊… 咦？ 那个…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.13,0:14:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底发生了什么 怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.16,0:14:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}女孩子从木桶里出来了汪。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.70,0:14:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 是那个女孩子在决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.73,0:14:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是狗在打吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此 她的决斗战术
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.93,0:14:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比游马还要强吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.15,0:14:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 叫什么名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}汪。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.85,0:14:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.06,0:14:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}汪。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.89,0:14:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说汪啦！汪酱是也！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.45,0:14:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.64,0:14:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}汪酱？为什么你要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成狗的样子来决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.86,0:14:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……我……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.87,0:14:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我害怕跟人说话。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以一直孤零零的一个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.65,0:14:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}朋友只有忠吉。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.47,0:14:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是我因为决斗……因为太喜欢决斗了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.18,0:15:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直～一直都拿忠吉当对手在决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.06,0:15:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忠吉拼命地记住了决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.93,0:15:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连抽卡都会了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.47,0:15:16.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 每天 每天你和我进行了决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 果然还是 想和各式各样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.48,0:15:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行决斗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我 化装成忠吉参加了这场大会。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.76,0:15:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是… 即使这样 果然还是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.78,0:15:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和陌生人说话好可怕……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.65,0:15:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后呢？ 你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.51,0:15:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这样继续决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.70,0:15:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是在这里投降放弃？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.24,0:15:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼… 果然喜欢狗的人 也就这种程度。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂… 喂。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.39,0:15:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别说话！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.30,0:15:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（吠叫声）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.50,0:15:51.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就那样 永远躲在狗的阴影里就好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.53,0:15:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（狗叫声）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.57,0:15:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.26,0:15:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底你就是条丧家犬！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.96,0:16:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.15,0:16:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你害怕对吧害怕自己亲自决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.67,0:16:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}汪！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.82,0:16:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.20,0:16:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来跟我一决胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.06,0:16:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正合我意！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.60,0:16:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会这样……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.29,0:16:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从狗与猫人的战斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.47,0:16:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然变成了狗人与猫人的战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.84,0:16:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.87,0:16:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 汪汪机会！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.07,0:16:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.06,0:16:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有等级3以上的怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.62,0:16:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将4只汪汪机会衍生物可以特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.82,0:16:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小狗的伙伴增加了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.96,0:16:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭借装备魔法狗狗之王的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.69,0:16:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}烟熏犬的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.05,0:17:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升２０００点。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗！用烟熏犬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.10,0:17:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击猫女魔法师！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.30,0:17:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡 打开！ 对猫弹琴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.51,0:17:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的猫咪被攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.20,0:17:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方攻击力一半的数值
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会加到自己怪兽的攻击力上。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.92,0:17:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 ５７５０！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.28,0:17:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超过烟熏犬了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.30,0:17:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完 烟熏犬还有效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.67,0:17:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}烟熏犬的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.86,0:17:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用１个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.42,0:17:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让陷阱效果无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.32,0:17:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！ 结果又变回原来的攻击力了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.19,0:17:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就是在等这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.72,0:17:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}烟熏犬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.70,0:17:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算能无效陷阱效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.59,0:17:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也没法无效魔法效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.45,0:17:58.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我场上的盖牌是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.55,0:18:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻魔法 反击·喵ounter哟。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.84,0:18:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是，当自己的陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.26,0:18:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.21,0:18:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方一张魔法陷阱卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.41,0:18:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，还能让我的一只猫猫攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.11,0:18:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到回合结束前变成两倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.46,0:18:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎 怎么会！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.81,0:18:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要破坏的是装备魔法 狗王。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.52,0:18:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要破坏这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.67,0:18:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}烟熏犬的攻击力就会变回2600。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.57,0:18:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.56,0:18:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猫女魔法师的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会提升到6400哟。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.79,0:18:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经 没有什么能保护你的了什么都没有……了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.00,0:18:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是我的逆转胜利。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.39,0:18:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《不行……赢不了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.58,0:18:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到头来我 一个人什么都做不到》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.95,0:18:48.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜～。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.02,0:18:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜～……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.10,0:19:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要放弃了吧 就像丧家之犬一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.33,0:19:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.68,0:19:12.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大家）哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.71,0:19:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论多少次 都不要放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.42,0:19:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天 小狗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.26,0:19:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 小狗！ 一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.96,0:19:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要放弃 去挑战啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.98,0:19:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小狗 别放弃啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对 不要放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.24,0:19:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯……没错我不能放弃。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.27,0:19:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不是什么丧家之犬。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.14,0:19:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要一飞冲天 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.66,0:19:44.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（吠叫声）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.36,0:19:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡 开启！ 孤高的远吠！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.73,0:19:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己的1张装备魔法破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.78,0:19:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让场上的所有怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.19,0:19:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力恢复原状。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.33,0:20:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}主动把自己的装备卡破坏掉{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.69,0:20:03.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你注意到不错的地方了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.21,0:20:06.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 烟熏狗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.28,0:20:11.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.72,0:20:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.46,0:20:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了！我赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.15,0:20:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得好 小狗酱！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.39,0:20:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.51,0:20:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…我、我的心灵碎片…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.50,0:20:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起。这个还给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.39,0:20:57.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这…这是我的…心灵碎片！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.93,0:21:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 这是我的心灵碎片。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.13,0:21:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}收下吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.27,0:21:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 可是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.99,0:21:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为你赢了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.16,0:21:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.89,0:21:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是一场非常精彩的狗狗决斗哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也是呢 一直以来只有猫咪是我的朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.45,0:21:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.64,0:21:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 在猫咪决斗中鼓起勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 进行了决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.36,0:21:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果就和大家都成了朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.56,0:21:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗会让大家都成为朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.76,0:21:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗会让大家都成为朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 你是故意……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.32,0:21:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵 你看看吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.80,0:21:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.24,0:21:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《观察结果 其18。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.27,0:21:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猫咪决斗和狗狗决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.79,0:21:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天这词 各种
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.80,0:21:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叫法不断变化并传播开来。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.17,0:21:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}传遍全世界的日子大概也不远了》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.37,0:22:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～嘞 我也要用元祖一飞冲天加油啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.91,0:22:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊 我！

